  "essential_limits": [
    "Conditional snapshot-wealth comparison against three fee-free frozen dividend policies, not a fully certified same-contract no-rebalance simulation.",
    "All3889 actual terminal fund NAVs equal public same-fund/same-date NAV; latest visible quote dates19Oct or16Oct, not20Oct closing NAV. TA and dividends posted20Oct are included in actual book.",
    "Frozen upper uses the per-fund ex-post best of cash dividends, ex-NAV reinvestment and cash sweep; not a single ex-ante executable policy.",
    "For conservative upper, frozen money funds are granted all positive published income through20Oct, even where not yet visible in the20Oct snapshot. This favors frozen and cannot certify exact paid terminal differences.",
    "Actual book already reflects paid charges. Lower difference additionally subtracts the observed whole fee-chain lifetime cumulative accrual, deliberately including previously paid amounts; this is a conservative sensitivity penalty, not exact unpaid liability.",
    "Operational rounding .01share per dividend, .01yuan per dividend, .02yuan per money-fund account held day plus .0001 per10000units/day quote envelope are explicit conditional assumptions, not universally proved TA guarantees.",
    "Upper difference uses nonnegative money income omitted for frozen lower and no extra unpaid actual fee; negative/positive counts refer to this free-self-hold policy scenario, not same-contract harm certification.",
